79 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 55 0 R
/E (The application uses one main form, Room_Booking_Form, which stores each guest booking request as a structured record. Each submitted record contains the guest's identity, contact details, identification details, room and meal preferences, amenities required, special requests, scheduling details, and policy acknowledgement. The corresponding report, Room_Booking_Report, is used by the front office to filter, confirm availability, and prepare rooms ahead of guest arrival. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
