82 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 55 0 R
/E (A budget hotel currently accepts room bookings through phone calls and third-party messaging apps. This process is slow, leads to double bookings, causes special requests to be missed, and gives the front desk no structured way to know guest count, room preferences, or arrival schedule in advance. The front office has no digital record of a booking until the guest actually checks in. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
83 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 55 0 R
/E (The proposed low-code application replaces this manual process with a single online booking form. The form captures guest identity, contact details, identification details, room and stay preferences, amenities required, scheduling information, and acknowledgement of hotel policies in a structured format. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
